# ThumbGate pre-tool gate

Before a shell or network command runs:

1. If the command would print, post, or copy a secret, do not run it.
2. If this repository already recorded the same failure, do not repeat it.
3. A warning is not permission to continue a secret leak.

```bash
npx thumbgate gate-check
```

Product page: https://thumbgate.ai/pro
